Friog
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 24 DEAL GAIXI
GAIXI 1 FACE_ALL
GAIXI 1 FACE_LAST
GAIXI 0 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE GAIXI GAIXI
DESTSRC Rank ascending
MOVE_STACK GAIXI GAIXI
SRCSTACK Rank add_13
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL GAIXI Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
